{"4162310": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ALYUP", "steam_appid": 4162310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alyup is <strong>the</strong> <strong>baller's </strong>ultimate power fantasy. Command a growing team of hyperspheres.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162310/extras/ebfd76bc280720e7bfe25bef3e302465.poster.avif?t=1782852933\" width=746 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162310/extras/ebfd76bc280720e7bfe25bef3e302465.webm?t=1782852933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162310/extras/ebfd76bc280720e7bfe25bef3e302465.mp4?t=1782852933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Cosmic balls bursting with godlike super abilities, in a thrilling blend of vertical platforming and razor-sharp strategic arena battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast off as blazing rockets, ascending the vast reaches of space through challenging vertical levels filled with precarious platforms, deadly hazards, and hidden secrets. Reach epic battle arenas where you'll face off against scaling enemy teams in intense, turn-based tactical combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue your captured allies by defeating foes to unlock new hyperspheres for your squad, each bringing unique powers to the fight. Grind individual stats up to <strong>level 999</strong> for devastating, apocalyptic blows that turn the tide of battle, while enemies grow ever stronger alongside you across <strong><u>100</u></strong> progressively tougher stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategy is everything: one devastating enemy attack can instantly wipe your entire team, forcing you to master positioning, ability synergies, and clever tactics to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162310/extras/75ab2629614f05b9bc0492b761ed09e3.poster.avif?t=1782852933\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162310/extras/75ab2629614f05b9bc0492b761ed09e3.webm?t=1782852933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162310/extras/75ab2629614f05b9bc0492b761ed09e3.mp4?t=1782852933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harvest mid-level boss drops for vital consumables to turn the tide of battle, unlock flashy skins, powerful skills, and game-changing abilities as you build the ultimate hypersphere roster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to unleash cosmic fury and become unstoppable? Dive into Alyup and experience the ultimate sphere-based power trip!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162310/extras/0d2b524e0aa92f1eae0088f759d00b6e.poster.avif?t=1782852933\" width=746 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162310/extras/0d2b524e0aa92f1eae0088f759d00b6e.webm?t=1782852933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162310/extras/0d2b524e0aa92f1eae0088f759d00b6e.mp4?t=1782852933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local multiplayer:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player 1 always has access to keyboard and mouse, and will also pick up the first gamepad if two controllers are connected. Player 2 uses a gamepad exclusively. If only one controller is plugged in, it automatically goes to Player 2 while Player 1 plays on keyboard. If two controllers are connected, the first one goes to Player 1 and the second to Player 2. Controllers are remembered across disconnects, so if a gamepad drops out and reconnects mid-session, it returns to the same player automatically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alyup is <strong>the</strong> <strong>baller's </strong>ultimate power fantasy. Command a growing team of hyperspheres.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162310/extras/ebfd76bc280720e7bfe25bef3e302465.poster.avif?t=1782852933\" width=746 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162310/extras/ebfd76bc280720e7bfe25bef3e302465.webm?t=1782852933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162310/extras/ebfd76bc280720e7bfe25bef3e302465.mp4?t=1782852933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Cosmic balls bursting with godlike super abilities, in a thrilling blend of vertical platforming and razor-sharp strategic arena battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast off as blazing rockets, ascending the vast reaches of space through challenging vertical levels filled with precarious platforms, deadly hazards, and hidden secrets. Reach epic battle arenas where you'll face off against scaling enemy teams in intense, turn-based tactical combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue your captured allies by defeating foes to unlock new hyperspheres for your squad, each bringing unique powers to the fight. Grind individual stats up to <strong>level 999</strong> for devastating, apocalyptic blows that turn the tide of battle, while enemies grow ever stronger alongside you across <strong><u>100</u></strong> progressively tougher stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategy is everything: one devastating enemy attack can instantly wipe your entire team, forcing you to master positioning, ability synergies, and clever tactics to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162310/extras/75ab2629614f05b9bc0492b761ed09e3.poster.avif?t=1782852933\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162310/extras/75ab2629614f05b9bc0492b761ed09e3.webm?t=1782852933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162310/extras/75ab2629614f05b9bc0492b761ed09e3.mp4?t=1782852933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harvest mid-level boss drops for vital consumables to turn the tide of battle, unlock flashy skins, powerful skills, and game-changing abilities as you build the ultimate hypersphere roster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to unleash cosmic fury and become unstoppable? Dive into Alyup and experience the ultimate sphere-based power trip!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162310/extras/0d2b524e0aa92f1eae0088f759d00b6e.poster.avif?t=1782852933\" width=746 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162310/extras/0d2b524e0aa92f1eae0088f759d00b6e.webm?t=1782852933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162310/extras/0d2b524e0aa92f1eae0088f759d00b6e.mp4?t=1782852933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local multiplayer:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player 1 always has access to keyboard and mouse, and will also pick up the first gamepad if two controllers are connected. Player 2 uses a gamepad exclusively. If only one controller is plugged in, it automatically goes to Player 2 while Player 1 plays on keyboard. If two controllers are connected, the first one goes to Player 1 and the second to Player 2. Controllers are remembered across disconnects, so if a gamepad drops out and reconnects mid-session, it returns to the same player automatically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Alyup: An insane power fantasy. Unleash a cosmic barrage of hyperspheres with godlike powers, ascend the vast reaches of space like blazing rockets to razor-edged arena clashes, rescue fallen allies in tactical duels, grind stats to forge apocalyptic strikes, or perish in one devastating flash!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162310/218596ed11d71a273bfa2ffdf4a2ed443a668e26/header.jpg?t=1782852933", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162310/15cff3a3ba72bab8d81d6f0ea5474d61135cce37/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782852933", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162310/15cff3a3ba72bab8d81d6f0ea5474d61135cce37/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782852933", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 5 1600 / Core i5-7600K<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><